    "extracted_answer": "[odd, '\\\\text{odd}']",
    "gold_answer": "We have that\n\\begin{align*}\nf(-x) &= \\frac{5^{-x} - 1}{5^{-x} + 1} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1 - 5^x}{1 + 5^x} \\\\\n&= -\\frac{5^x - 1}{5^x + 1} \\\\\n&= -f(x),\n\\end{align*}so $f(x)$ is an $\\boxed{\\text{odd}}$ function.",
